<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Ardi Store — Top Up Diamond</title>

<style>

@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap');

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

html{
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
    font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
    background:#080a12;
    color:#fff;
    overflow-x:hidden;
}

/* =========================
   BACKGROUND
========================= */

body::before{
    content:"";
    position:fixed;
    width:650px;
    height:650px;
    background:#6d4aff;
    filter:blur(200px);
    opacity:.15;
    top:-300px;
    left:-250px;
    z-index:-2;
}

body::after{
    content:"";
    position:fixed;
    width:600px;
    height:600px;
    background:#00d9ff;
    filter:blur(220px);
    opacity:.10;
    right:-300px;
    bottom:-250px;
    z-index:-2;
}

/* =========================
   NAVBAR
========================= */

.navbar{
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    z-index:999;

    background:rgba(7,9,17,.86);

    backdrop-filter:blur(20px);

    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}

.nav-inner{
    max-width:1150px;
    margin:auto;

    padding:15px 20px;

    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
}

.logo{
    font-size:21px;
    font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:-.5px;
}

.logo span{
    color:#8b6cff;
}

.nav-menu{
    display:flex;
    gap:27px;
}

.nav-menu a{
    color:#9fa5b8;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:700;
}

.nav-menu a:hover{
    color:#fff;
}

.cart-btn{
    border:none;

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            #7657ff,
            #a855f7
        );

    color:white;

    padding:10px 15px;

    border-radius:12px;

    font-weight:900;

    cursor:pointer;

    box-shadow:
        0 10px 30px rgba(124,92,255,.25);
}

/* =========================
   HERO
========================= */

.hero{
    max-width:1150px;

    margin:auto;

    padding:70px 20px 45px;

    display:grid;

    grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;

    gap:40px;

    align-items:center;
}

.hero-badge{
    display:inline-flex;

    align-items:center;

    gap:7px;

    padding:8px 14px;

    border-radius:50px;

    background:rgba(124,92,255,.10);

    border:1px solid rgba(124,92,255,.30);

    color:#b8aaff;

    font-size:11px;

    font-weight:900;

    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(43px,7vw,78px);

    line-height:.94;

    font-weight:900;

    letter-spacing:-4px;
}

.hero h1 span{
    background:
        linear-gradient(
            90deg,
            #8b5cf6,
            #22d3ee,
            #60a5fa
        );

    -webkit-background-clip:text;

    color:transparent;
}

.hero-description{
    color:#9298ab;

    max-width:600px;

    font-size:14px;

    line-height:1.9;

    margin-top:22px;
}

.hero-buttons{
    display:flex;

    flex-wrap:wrap;

    gap:12px;

    margin-top:27px;
}

.btn-primary{
    display:inline-block;

    padding:14px 22px;

    border-radius:13px;

    text-decoration:none;

    color:white;

    font-weight:900;

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            #7657ff,
            #a855f7
        );

    box-shadow:
        0 12px 35px rgba(124,92,255,.25);
}

.btn-secondary{
    display:inline-block;

    padding:14px 22px;

    border-radius:13px;

    text-decoration:none;

    color:white;

    font-weight:800;

    background:#ffffff08;

    border:1px solid #ffffff13;
}

/* =========================
   HERO VISUAL
========================= */

.hero-visual{
    min-height:390px;

    position:relative;

    overflow:hidden;

    border-radius:30px;

    background:
        radial-gradient(
            circle at 50% 35%,
            rgba(34,211,238,.18),
            transparent 30%
        ),
        linear-gradient(
            145deg,
            #16132b,
            #0d111d
        );

    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);

    box-shadow:
        0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.35);

    display:flex;

    justify-content:center;

    align-items:center;
}

.hero-visual::before,
.hero-visual::after{
    content:"";

    position:absolute;

    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);

    border-radius:50%;
}

.hero-visual::before{
    width:270px;
    height:270px;
}

.hero-visual::after{
    width:360px;
    height:360px;

    border-color:rgba(124,92,255,.13);
}

/* REALISTIC DIAMOND */

.diamond{
    position:relative;

    width:205px;
    height:170px;

    z-index:5;

    filter:
        drop-shadow(0 0 22px rgba(34,211,238,.45))
        drop-shadow(0 25px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.6));

    animation:
        diamondFloat 3.5s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.diamond-top{
    position:absolute;

    top:0;
    left:0;

    width:100%;
    height:38%;

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            #ffffff,
            #b8f7ff 35%,
            #53d8ff 70%,
            #3182ff
        );

    clip-path:
        polygon(
            12% 0,
            88% 0,
            100% 100%,
            0 100%
        );
}

.diamond-body{
    position:absolute;

    left:0;
    bottom:0;

    width:100%;
    height:70%;

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            #36dfff,
            #3989ff 48%,
            #714cff
        );

    clip-path:
        polygon(
            0 0,
            100% 0,
            78% 100%,
            22% 100%
        );
}

.diamond-facet-one{
    position:absolute;

    z-index:10;

    left:50%;
    top:0;

    width:2px;
    height:100%;

    background:rgba(255,255,255,.7);

    transform:rotate(7deg);

    opacity:.6;
}

.diamond-facet-two{
    position:absolute;

    z-index:10;

    left:25%;

    top:38%;

    width:50%;

    height:2px;

    background:rgba(255,255,255,.35);
}

.diamond-shine{
    position:absolute;

    z-index:20;

    width:38px;
    height:100px;

    top:25px;
    left:47px;

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            90deg,
            transparent,
            rgba(255,255,255,.65),
            transparent
        );

    transform:rotate(25deg);

    filter:blur(2px);

    opacity:.7;
}

@keyframes diamondFloat{

    0%,100%{
        transform:
            translateY(0)
            rotate(-2deg);
    }

    50%{
        transform:
            translateY(-14px)
            rotate(2deg);
    }

}

.floating-label{
    position:absolute;

    z-index:20;

    background:
        rgba(17,20,32,.92);

    border:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);

    padding:11px 14px;

    border-radius:13px;

    font-size:11px;

    font-weight:800;

    box-shadow:
        0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
}

.label-one{
    top:28px;
    right:25px;
}

.label-two{
    bottom:28px;
    left:25px;
}

/* =========================
   PROMO
========================= */

.promo{
    max-width:1150px;

    margin:auto;

    padding:0 20px;
}

.promo-box{
    padding:18px 22px;

    display:flex;

    justify-content:space-between;

    align-items:center;

    gap:20px;

    border-radius:18px;

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            90deg,
            rgba(124,92,255,.17),
            rgba(34,211,238,.07)
        );

    border:
        1px solid rgba(124,92,255,.23);
}

.promo-title{
    font-size:14px;

    font-weight:900;
}

.promo-text{
    color:#969caf;

    font-size:11px;

    line-height:1.7;

    margin-top:3px;
}

.promo-icon{
    font-size:32px;
}

/* =========================
   PAYMENT NOTICE
========================= */

.payment-notice{
    max-width:1110px;

    margin:20px auto 0;

    padding:20px;

    display:flex;

    align-items:flex-start;

    gap:17px;

    border-radius:18px;

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            rgba(245,158,11,.11),
            rgba(239,68,68,.06)
        );

    border:
        1px solid rgba(245,158,11,.30);
}

.payment-icon{
    min-width:52px;

    height:52px;

    display:flex;

    align-items:center;

    justify-content:center;

    border-radius:14px;

    background:
        rgba(245,158,11,.12);

    font-size:27px;
}

.payment-title{
    color:#fbbf24;

    font-size:14px;

    font-weight:900;

    margin-bottom:5px;
}

.payment-text{
    color:#9da3b6;

    font-size:11px;

    line-height:1.8;
}

.payment-text strong{
    color:white;
}

/* =========================
   SECTION
========================= */

.section{
    max-width:1150px;

    margin:auto;

    padding:60px 20px;
}

.section-title{
    text-align:center;

    margin-bottom:30px;
}

.section-title small{
    color:#8875ff;

    font-size:10px;

    font-weight:900;

    letter-spacing:3px;
}

.section-title h2{
    font-size:34px;

    margin-top:6px;
}

.section-title p{
    color:#777e92;

    font-size:13px;

    margin-top:5px;
}

/* =========================
   PRODUCTS
========================= */

.products{
    display:grid;

    grid-template-columns:
        repeat(4,1fr);

    gap:16px;
}

.product{
    position:relative;

    overflow:hidden;

    padding:17px;

    border-radius:20px;

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            145deg,
            #151827,
            #0e111b
        );

    border:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);

    transition:.25s;
}

.product:hover{
    transform:translateY(-7px);

    border-color:
        rgba(124,92,255,.55);

    box-shadow:
        0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
}

.product.popular{
    border-color:
        rgba(139,92,246,.45);
}

.popular-badge{
    position:absolute;

    top:12px;

    right:12px;

    padding:5px 8px;

    border-radius:7px;

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            #7657ff,
            #a855f7
        );

    font-size:8px;

    font-weight:900;
}

/* PRODUCT DIAMOND */

.product-icon{
    height:115px;

    display:flex;

    align-items:center;

    justify-content:center;

    border-radius:15px;

    margin-bottom:14px;

    background:
        radial-gradient(
            circle,
            rgba(34,211,238,.12),
            transparent 65%
        ),
        #0a0e18;
}

.mini-diamond{
    position:relative;

    width:75px;
    height:62px;

    filter:
        drop-shadow(
            0 0 13px
            rgba(34,211,238,.4)
        );
}

.mini-diamond .top{
    position:absolute;

    width:100%;
    height:40%;

    top:0;

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            #fff,
            #8defff,
            #3b9cff
        );

    clip-path:
        polygon(
            12% 0,
            88% 0,
            100% 100%,
            0 100%
        );
}

.mini-diamond .body{
    position:absolute;

    width:100%;
    height:70%;

    bottom:0;

    background:
        linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            #28dfff,
            #397fff,
            #7650ff
        );

    clip-path:
        polygon(
            0 0,
            100% 0,
            78% 100%,
            22% 100%
        );
}

.product h3{
    font-size:17px;
}

.product-desc{
    color:#71788c;

    font-size:10px;

    margin-top:3px;
}

.price{
    font-size:17px;

    font-weight:900;

    margin:11px 0;
}

.buy{
    width:100%;

    padding:11px;

    border:none;

    border-radius:10px;

    background:#fff;

    color:#090b13;

    font-weight:900;

    cursor:pointer;

    transition:.2s;
}

.buy:hover{
    background:#8b6cff;

    color:white;
}

/* =========================
   BENEFITS
========================= */

.benefits{
    display:grid;

    grid-template-columns:
        repeat(3,1fr);

    gap:16px;
}

.benefit{
    padding:23px;

    border-radius:18px;

    background:#111420;

    border:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
}

.benefit-icon{
    font-size:29px;
}

.benefit h3{
    margin-top:10px;

    font-size:16px;
}

.benefit p{
    color:#7e8498;

    font-size:12px;

    line-height:1.8;

    margin-top:5px;
}

/* =========================
   FOOTER
========================= */

footer{
    padding:35px 20px;

    text-align:center;

    border-top:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);

    color:#646b7e;

    font-size:11px;

    line-height:1.8;
}

/* =========================
   WHATSAPP
========================= */

.wa{
    position:fixed;

    z-index:1500;

    right:18px;

    bottom:18px;

    display:flex;

    align-items:center;

    gap:7px;

    padding:13px 17px;

    border-radius:50px;

    background:#22c55e;

    color:white;

    text-decoration:none;

    font-size:12px;

    font-weight:900;

    box-shadow:
        0 12px 35px
        rgba(34,197,94,.3);
}

/* =========================
   MODAL
========================= */

.modal{
    position:fixed;

    inset:0;

    z-index:3000;

    display:none;

    align-items:flex-end;

    justify-content:center;

    background:
        rgba(0,0,0,.78);

    backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
}

.modal.active{
    display:flex;
}

.cart-box{
    width:min(600px,100%);

    max-height:90vh;

    overflow:auto;

    padding:25px;

    border-radius:
        25px 25px 0 0;

    background:#111420;

    border:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);

    animation:
        slideUp .25s ease;
}

@keyframes slideUp{

    from{
        transform:translateY(100%);
    }

    to{
        transform:translateY(0);
    }

}

.cart-head{
    display:flex;

    align-items:center;

    justify-content:space-between;
}

.cart-head h2{
    font-size:20px;
}

.close{
    border:none;

    background:#252a39;

    color:white;

    padding:8px 11px;

    border-radius:8px;

    cursor:pointer;
}

.cart-item{
    display:flex;

    align-items:center;

    justify-content:space-between;

    gap:15px;

    padding:15px 0;

    border-bottom:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
}

.cart-item-name{
    font-weight:800;

    font-size:14px;
}

.cart-item-price{
    color:#8b78ff;

    font-size:12px;

    margin-top:2px;
}

.quantity{
    display:flex;

    align-items:center;

    gap:8px;
}

.quantity button{
    width:28px;

    height:28px;

    border:none;

    border-radius:7px;

    background:#272c3b;

    color:white;

    cursor:pointer;
}

.total{
    display:flex;

    justify-content:space-between;

    margin:20px 0;

    font-size:19px;

    font-weight:900;
}

input{
    width:100%;

    padding:13px;

    margin-bottom:10px;

    border-radius:11px;

    outline:none;

    border:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);

    background:#090c14;

    color:white;

    font-family:inherit;
}

.payment-warning{
    margin:15px 0;

    padding:15px;

    border-radius:13px;

    background:
        rgba(239,68,68,.07);

    border:
        1px solid rgba(239,68,68,.25);

    color:#aeb4c4;

    font-size:11px;

    line-height:1.8;
}

.payment-warning strong{
    color:#ff7373;
}

.checkout{
    width:100%;

    padding:14px;

    border:none;

    border-radius:11px;

    background:#22c55e;

    color:white;

    font-weight:900;

    cursor:pointer;
}

/* =========================
   MOBILE
========================= */

@media(max-width:900px){

    .hero{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .products{
        grid-template-columns:
            repeat(3,1fr);
    }

}

@media(max-width:650px){

    .nav-menu{
        display:none;
    }

    .hero{
        padding-top:45px;
    }

    .hero h1{
        letter-spacing:-2px;
    }

    .products{
        grid-template-columns:
            repeat(2,1fr);

        gap:10px;
    }

    .product{
        padding:12px;
    }

    .product-icon{
        height:95px;
    }

    .benefits{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .promo-icon{
        display:none;
    }

    .payment-notice{
        margin-left:20px;
        margin-right:20px;
    }

}

@media(max-width:400px){

    .hero-visual{
        min-height:310px;
    }

    .hero h1{
        font-size:42px;
    }

    .price{
        font-size:15px;
    }

}

</style>
</head>


<body>


<!-- =========================
     NAVBAR
========================= -->

<nav class="navbar">

<div class="nav-inner">

    <div class="logo">
        💎 ARDI<span>STORE</span>
    </div>

    <div class="nav-menu">

        <a href="#harga">
            Harga
        </a>

        <a href="#keunggulan">
            Keunggulan
        </a>

        <a href="#cara">
            Cara Order
        </a>

    </div>

    <button
        class="cart-btn"
        onclick="openCart()"
    >

        🛒 Keranjang
        (<span id="cartCount">0</span>)

    </button>

</div>

</nav>


<!-- =========================
     HERO
========================= -->

<section class="hero">

<div>

    <div class="hero-badge">

        🔥 TOP UP CEPAT & PRAKTIS

    </div>


    <h1>

        TOP UP<br>

        <span>DIAMOND</span><br>

        SEPUASNYA!

    </h1>


    <p class="hero-description">

        Mau beli bundle, skin, emote,
        atau sekadar menambah diamond?
        Pilih nominal yang kamu mau,
        masukkan ID Player, lalu lakukan
        pembayaran langsung kepada
        Mas Ardi / Mbude Sarti.

    </p>


    <div class="hero-buttons">

        <a
            href="#harga"
            class="btn-primary"
        >

            💎 BELI DIAMOND

        </a>


        <a
            href="#cara"
            class="btn-secondary"
        >

            📖 CARA ORDER

        </a>

    </div>

</div>


<!-- VISUAL -->

<div class="hero-visual">


    <div class="floating-label label-one">

        ⚡ Cepat & Praktis

    </div>


    <div class="diamond">

        <div class="diamond-top"></div>

        <div class="diamond-body"></div>

        <div class="diamond-facet-one"></div>

        <div class="diamond-facet-two"></div>

        <div class="diamond-shine"></div>

    </div>


    <div class="floating-label label-two">

        💎 Banyak Pilihan

    </div>


</div>

</section>


<!-- =========================
     PROMO
========================= -->

<div class="promo">

<div class="promo-box">

    <div>

        <div class="promo-title">

            🎉 SIAP PUSH RANK?

        </div>


        <div class="promo-text">

            Pilih diamond → checkout →
            bayar lunas → diamond dikirim.

        </div>

    </div>


    <div class="promo-icon">

        💎🔥

    </div>

</div>

</div>


<!-- =========================
     PAYMENT NOTICE
========================= -->

<section class="payment-notice">

    <div class="payment-icon">

        💰

    </div>


    <div>

        <div class="payment-title">

            ⚠️ PEMBAYARAN WAJIB LUNAS TERLEBIH DAHULU

        </div>


        <div class="payment-text">

            Untuk menghindari drama dan masalah
            utang-piutang, semua pesanan wajib
            <strong>dibayar terlebih dahulu</strong>.

            <br>

            Pembayaran dilakukan secara langsung
            kepada <strong>Mas Ardi atau Mbude Sarti</strong>.

            <br>

            Setelah pembayaran diterima,
            diamond atau produk akan dikirim.

            <br><br>

            🚫 <strong>TIDAK MENERIMA HUTANG / BAYAR NANTI.</strong>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================
     HARGA
========================= -->

<section
    class="section"
    id="harga"
>


<div class="section-title">

    <small>
        PRICE LIST
    </small>


    <h2>
        💎 PILIH DIAMOND
    </h2>


    <p>
        Pilih nominal sesuai kebutuhanmu.
    </p>

</div>


<div
    class="products"
    id="products"
></div>


</section>


<!-- =========================
     KEUNGGULAN
========================= -->

<section
    class="section"
    id="keunggulan"
>


<div class="section-title">

    <small>
        WHY ARDI STORE?
    </small>


    <h2>
        KENAPA BELI DI SINI?
    </h2>

</div>


<div class="benefits">


    <di
